'''C&C Minecarts Co.''' was a [[Location]] in the [[Dwarven Mines]]. It has since been replaced with the {{Zone|Abandoned Quarry}}. 

== Purpose ==
'''C&C Minecarts Co.''' had no functionality and served as a staircase from the {{Zone|Rampart's Quarry}} into the {{Zone|Upper Mines}}.

